# User-defined type class with functional dependency (a, b) -> c.
# Verifies that class declarations with FD determines/resolver metadata typecheck without errors.
# The resolver AddResult is from the prelude and computes c from (a, b).
[
  TestAdd: [class [let TestAdd a b c] [determines: [[[a b] c]] resolver: AddResult]
    add: [Fn@c [a b]]]

  result: [+ 1 2]
]
---
%.result
=== out
Int(3)
